-- 5a. autumn 2025: A1 01:30-02:30 (ambiguous logout), A2 02:30-03:30 (ambiguous login), A3 01:00-04:00 (spans the change)
       key       | status | period_from | period_to  |     timezone     
-----------------+--------+-------------+------------+------------------
 dst-autumn-2025 | staged | 2025-10-25  | 2025-10-26 | Europe/Amsterdam

INSERT 0 3
INSERT 0 3
 status |                                                                                                                                        counts                                                                                                                                         
--------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 loaded | {"sessions_in": 3, "days_clipped": 0, "days_dropped": 0, "days_written": 3, "events_written": 6, "sessions_merged": 0, "accounts_skipped": 0, "sessions_unmapped": 0, "days_closed_by_rule": 0, "days_skipped_existing": 0, "sessions_open_dropped": 0, "sessions_outside_window": 0}

 acct | business_date | seconds |         hours          |               events                
------+---------------+---------+------------------------+-------------------------------------
 A1   | 2025-10-26    |    7200 |     2.0000000000000000 | 23:30Z=01:30local 01:30Z=02:30local
 A2   | 2025-10-26    |    3600 | 1.00000000000000000000 | 01:30Z=02:30local 02:30Z=03:30local
 A3   | 2025-10-26    |   14400 |     4.0000000000000000 | 23:00Z=01:00local 03:00Z=04:00local

Expected (PostgreSQL reads an ambiguous local time as standard time, CET, the later instant): A1 7200 s (02:30 -> CET = 01:30Z), A2 3600 s, A3 14400 s (4 real hours; the wall clock says 3). A Steam logout really at 02:30 CEST would count one hour too long: documented behaviour (README 0008d), outside Pulse4all's imported period.
